OL,3,GNEWSAPlanes back at RAF's largest base
OL,4,Aafter runway repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights have returned to the RAF's
OL,7,Flargest airbase following a #180m
OL,8,Fupgrade centred on its runway.
OL,10,FRAF Brize Norton in Oxfordshire closed
OL,11,Fits runway in July for work the
OL,12,FMinistry of Defence said would ensure
OL,13,Fit remained "fully operational and fit"
OL,14,Fin the long term.
OL,16,FOver the past four months, the entire
OL,17,F1.9-mile (3km) runway has been dug up
OL,18,Fand relaid, with upgrades also made to
OL,19,Ftaxiways, lighting and drainage.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
