OL,3,GNEWSAPlanes back at RAF's largest base
OL,4,Aafter runway repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, RAF Voyager Vespina - which
OL,7,Fis often used to transport VIPs
OL,8,Fincluding the royal family - became the
OL,9,Ffirst aircraft to arrive on the new
OL,10,Frunway.
